790
00:49:13,501 --> 00:49:14,781
distracted.

791
00:49:14,861 --> 00:49:16,141
So I see.

792
00:49:16,181 --> 00:49:19,381
Well, no matter.
I usually find
what I'm after.

793
00:49:19,541 --> 00:49:24,101
